#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/anim_stack.rst:2
msgid "anim_stack"
msgstr "anim_stack"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack:1 of
msgid "用于记录作用于特定 :class:`~.Item` 上的 :class:`~.StackableAnimation`，形成一个堆栈"
msgstr "Used to record the :class:`~.StackableAnimation` objects applied to a specific :class:`~.Item`, forming a stack"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack:3 of
msgid "JAnim 动画的核心逻辑："
msgstr "The core logic of JAnim animations:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack:5 of
msgid "后一个动画，会以前一个动画的结果为基础，继续叠加作用"
msgstr "Each later animation is applied on top of the result of the previous one."

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack:7 of
msgid "这就是我们“动画复合”功能的内部逻辑，这个内部结构我们将其称作“动画堆栈”"
msgstr ""
"This is the internal logic behind JAnim's animation combination feature; we refer to this internal structure as the "
"animation stack."

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get_at_left_ctx:1 of
msgid "用于标记 :meth:`compute` 的 ``get_at_left`` 行为"
msgstr "Used to mark the behavior of :meth:`compute` when using ``get_at_left``"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get_at_left_ctx:3 of
msgid ""
"with ContextSetter(AnimStack.get_at_left_ctx, True):\n"
"    stack.compute(...)"
msgstr ""
"with ContextSetter(AnimStack.get_at_left_ctx, True):\n"
"    stack.compute(...)"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get_at_left_ctx:8 of
msgid "使用该 ``ContextVar`` 而非直接向 :meth:`compute` 设置参数，是为了让嵌套调用也能被标记使用 ``get_at_left`` 来处理"
msgstr ""
"Using this ``ContextVar`` instead of directly setting parameters for :meth:`compute` allows nested calls to also be "
"marked as using ``get_at_left`` for processing"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.display:1 of
msgid "将物件当前的状态记录到动画堆栈中，将 ``global_t`` 之后都显示为该状态"
msgstr "Records the current state of the item into the animation stack, making it display this state after ``global_t``"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.detect_change:1 of
msgid "若物件相比 ``self._prev_display`` 所记录的状态可能有变化， 则将新的状态记录到 ``global_t`` 之后的堆栈中"
msgstr ""
"If the item may have changed compared to the state recorded by ``self._prev_display``, records the new state into the "
"stack after ``global_t``"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.may_changed:1 of
msgid "检查物件相比 ``self._prev_display`` 所记录的状态，是否可能发生变化"
msgstr "Checks whether the item may have changed compared to the state recorded by ``self._prev_display``"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:1 of
msgid "向堆栈添加一个 :class:`~.StackableAnimation` 对象"
msgstr "Adds a :class:`~.StackableAnimation` object to the stack"

#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/anim_stack.rst janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add
#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute of
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:3 of
msgid "要向堆栈添加的动画对象"
msgstr "The animation object to add to the stack"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:5 of
msgid "策略："
msgstr "Strategy:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:7 of
msgid ""
"首先，给出一个直观的理解，我们可以将时间轴看作一个条形的画布，颜料可以一直往上叠加， 我们每使用该方法添加一个动画对象，就"
"是根据动画时间的起止范围，在这个画布上画上一笔"
msgstr ""
"First, for an intuitive understanding, we can view the timeline as a strip-shaped canvas where paint can continuously be "
"layered. Each time we use this method to add an animation object, it is like drawing on this canvas according to the "
"animation's start and end times"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:10 of
msgid "从而，在时间轴的不同区间，层层叠叠地叠加上了各个不同的动画对象，不同区间中会有不同的动画对象在发挥作用"
msgstr ""
"As a result, different animation objects are layered over different intervals of the timeline, and different objects take "
"effect in different intervals"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:12 of
msgid "为了得知在某个时刻 ``t`` 有那些动画对象在发挥作用， 我们肯定不能遍历曾经作用过的所有动画来筛选，这样效率太过低下了"
msgstr ""
"To determine which animation objects are active at a given time ``t``, we cannot simply iterate through all animations "
"that have ever been applied, as this would be far too inefficient"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:15 of
msgid ""
"所以，我们这个物件的动画堆栈，会根据每个动画的起止时刻切分为多个区块， 我们只需要二分查找出 ``t`` 所处的区块，便可以知道在"
"这个时刻会有哪些动画在发挥作用"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, this item's animation stack is divided into multiple chunks according to the start and end times of each "
"animation. We only need to use binary search to find the chunk containing ``t`` to determine which animations are active "
"at that moment"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:18 janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:12 of
msgid "例如："
msgstr "For example:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:20 of
msgid "如果我们有先后两个动画，``A 0~3s`` 以及 ``B 1~2s``"
msgstr "If we have two animations in sequence, ``A 0~3s`` and ``B 1~2s``"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:22 of
msgid "一开始为："
msgstr "Initially:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:24 of
msgid ""
"starts:  0\n"
"chunks: [ ]"
msgstr ""
"starts:  0\n"
"chunks: [ ]"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:29 of
msgid "当我们先加入 ``A`` 后："
msgstr "After adding ``A`` first:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:31 of
msgid ""
"starts:  0     |  3\n"
"chunks: [A]    | [ ]"
msgstr ""
"starts:  0     |  3\n"
"chunks: [A]    | [ ]"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:36 of
msgid "接着加入 ``B`` 后："
msgstr "After adding ``B``:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:38 of
msgid ""
"starts:  0     |  1     |  2     |  3\n"
"chunks: [A]    | [A,B]  | [A]    | [ ]"
msgstr ""
"starts:  0     |  1     |  2     |  3\n"
"chunks: [A]    | [A,B]  | [A]    | [ ]"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:43 of
msgid "可以看到，为了加入 ``B``，我们会在 ``1s`` 和 ``2s`` 的位置分别砍一刀"
msgstr "As can be seen, to add ``B``, we split the timeline at ``1s`` and ``2s`` respectively"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:45 of
msgid "如果我们再接着加入 ``C 2s~FOREVER``，则："
msgstr "If we then add ``C 2s~FOREVER``:"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:47 of
msgid ""
"starts:  0     |  1     |  2     |  3\n"
"chunks: [A]    | [A,B]  | [A,C]  | [C]"
msgstr ""
"starts:  0     |  1     |  2     |  3\n"
"chunks: [A]    | [A,B]  | [A,C]  | [C]"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:52 of
msgid ""
"注：由于 :class:`~.Animation` 都会经过 :meth:`~.TimeAligner.align_anim_or_record` 处理， 所以不必担心由于轻微浮点误差导致"
"产生多余的细切分的问题"
msgstr ""
"Note: Since all :class:`~.Animation` objects are processed by :meth:`~.TimeAligner.align_anim_or_record`, there is no "
"need to worry about unnecessary fine-grained splits caused by minor floating-point errors"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.add:55 of
msgid ""
"注：在添加时，大多数情况如上所示，但是如果动画的 ``_order`` 比较复杂， 我们需要将后来的动画插入到已有动画堆栈中，而不是直"
"接添加到末尾，这是为了保证每个区块内都是 ``_order`` 升序"
msgstr ""
"Note: During addition, most cases work as shown above. However, if the animation's ``_order`` is more complex, we need to "
"insert later animations into the existing animation stack rather than simply appending them, in order to ensure that "
"``_order`` remains in ascending order within each chunk"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get:1 janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get_at_left:1 of
msgid "得到 ``global_t`` 所处的区块（即在 ``global_t`` 时发挥作用的动画列表）"
msgstr "Gets the chunk containing ``global_t`` (that is, the list of animations active at ``global_t``)"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get_at_left:3 of
msgid ""
"和 :meth:`get` 不同，这个方法将区块区间当作左开右闭处理（即处于边界点时，得到左侧的区块）； 这个额外的方法在处理某些动画"
"的 ``become_at_end`` 时的计算比较有用"
msgstr ""
"Unlike :meth:`get`, this method treats chunk intervals as left-open and right-closed (that is, when at a boundary point, "
"it returns the chunk on the left). This additional method is useful when calculating ``become_at_end`` for certain "
"animations"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:3 janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get:5
#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get_at_left:6 of
msgid "全局时刻"
msgstr "Global time"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.get:3 of
msgid "在区间边界时，遵循区块区间左闭右开的原则（即处于边界点时，得到右侧的区块）"
msgstr ""
"At interval boundaries, follows the principle that chunk intervals are left-closed and right-open (that is, at a boundary "
"point, the chunk on the right is returned)"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:1 of
msgid "得到在 ``global_t`` 时刻下，应用动画作用效果后的物件"
msgstr "Gets the item after applying animation effects at ``global_t``"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:5 of
msgid ""
"表示调用方是否会对返回值进行修改  如果 ``readonly=True`` 则表示不会进行修改，该方法会直接返回缓存本身； 但是这并没有强制约"
"束性，传入 ``readonly=True`` 时需要遵循不修改返回值的原则，以免影响缓存数据  如果 ``readonly=False`` 则表示会进行修改，此"
"时会返回缓存的拷贝，从而避免影响缓存数据  例如：  -   :meth:`~.Timeline.item_current` 中的调用是 ``readonly=False`` "
"的，     因为其返回值最终会被用户使用，我们不能保证用户是否会修改  -   用于绘制时的调用是 ``readonly=True``，因为绘制时不"
"会对物件数据产生影响"
msgstr ""
"Indicates whether the caller will modify the return value. If ``readonly=True``, it means the value will not be modified, "
"and this method directly returns the cache itself. However, this is not a strict restriction; when passing "
"``readonly=True``, the caller must follow the principle of not modifying the return value to avoid affecting cached data. "
"If ``readonly=False``, it means the value may be modified, so a copy of the cache is returned to avoid affecting cached "
"data. For example:  - The call in :meth:`~.Timeline.item_current` uses ``readonly=False``, because its return value will "
"eventually be used by the user, and we cannot guarantee whether the user will modify it.  - The call used for rendering "
"uses ``readonly=True``, because rendering does not modify item data."

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:5 of
msgid "表示调用方是否会对返回值进行修改"
msgstr "Indicates whether the caller will modify the return value"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:7 of
msgid ""
"如果 ``readonly=True`` 则表示不会进行修改，该方法会直接返回缓存本身； 但是这并没有强制约束性，传入 ``readonly=True`` 时需"
"要遵循不修改返回值的原则，以免影响缓存数据"
msgstr ""
"If ``readonly=True``, it means no modification will be made, and the method directly returns the cache itself. However, "
"this is not a strict constraint; when passing ``readonly=True``, the caller should follow the principle of not modifying "
"the returned value to avoid affecting cached data"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:10 of
msgid "如果 ``readonly=False`` 则表示会进行修改，此时会返回缓存的拷贝，从而避免影响缓存数据"
msgstr ""
"If ``readonly=False``, it means the value may be modified, so a copy of the cache is returned to avoid affecting cached "
"data"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:14 of
msgid ""
":meth:`~.Timeline.item_current` 中的调用是 ``readonly=False`` 的， 因为其返回值最终会被用户使用，我们不能保证用户是否会修"
"改"
msgstr ""
"The call in :meth:`~.Timeline.item_current` uses ``readonly=False``, because its return value will eventually be used by "
"the user, and we cannot guarantee whether the user will modify it"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:17 of
msgid "用于绘制时的调用是 ``readonly=True``，因为绘制时不会对物件数据产生影响"
msgstr "The call used for rendering uses ``readonly=True``, because rendering does not modify item data"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:19 of
msgid ""
"默认使用 :meth:`get` 获取动画堆栈，可以设置 :py:obj:`get_at_left_ctx` 设定使用 :meth:`get_at_left` 获取动画堆栈， 具体请参"
"考 :py:obj:`get_at_left_ctx` 的文档"
msgstr ""
"By default, :meth:`get` is used to obtain the animation stack. You can set :py:obj:`get_at_left_ctx` to "
"use :meth:`get_at_left` instead. For details, see the documentation of :py:obj:`get_at_left_ctx`"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:22 of
msgid ""
"关于该方法的一些机制细节，请参考 :class:`~.StackableAnimation` 和 :class:`~.ApplyParams` 以及 :class:`~.ApplyAligner` 的介"
"绍"
msgstr ""
"For details about the mechanisms of this method, see the descriptions "
"of :class:`~.StackableAnimation`, :class:`~.ApplyParams`, and :class:`~.ApplyAligner`"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.AnimStack.compute:24 of
msgid "关于该方法在实现上的一些细节，请参考 ``_compute`` 代码中的注释"
msgstr "For implementation details of this method, see the comments in the ``_compute`` code"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.simplify_anim_stacks:1 of
msgid ""
"在 :class:`~.Timeline` 构建完成后，最后被调用，用于检查 :class:`~.Timeline` 中各个 :class:`~.AnimStack` 是否有可被简化的成"
"分"
msgstr ""
"Called after the construction of :class:`~.Timeline` is completed. It is used to check whether the :class:`~.AnimStack` "
"instances in the :class:`~.Timeline` contain components that can be simplified"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.simplify_anim_stacks:3 of
msgid "在没有 :class:`~.ApplyAligner` 出现的情况下，每个动画堆栈只需要保留最后一个 :class:`~.DisplayType` 及之后的动画即可"
msgstr ""
"When no :class:`~.ApplyAligner` appears, each animation stack only needs to retain the animations from the "
"last :class:`~.DisplayType` onwards"

#: janim.anims_core.anim_stack.simplify_anim_stacks:5 of
msgid ""
"在有 :class:`~.ApplyAligner` 出现的情况下，由于会出现动画堆栈之间的依赖，所以不能直接那样做，否则会破坏原本可能依赖"
"的 :class:`~.ApplyAligner`； 此时需要分析依赖内的所有 :class:`~.ApplyAligner`，判断他们是否可以同时被移除"
msgstr ""
"When a :class:`~.ApplyAligner` appears, dependencies between animation stacks may occur, so the previous simplification "
"cannot be applied directly, as it would break the :class:`~.ApplyAligner` that may be depended on. In this case, "
"all :class:`~.ApplyAligner` instances within the dependencies need to be analyzed to determine whether they can be "
"removed together"

